  // ── Skill detail / editor drill-in copy ────────────────────────────
  // Page-level UI strings consumed by /skill_detail.html + its glue
  // script (`src/scripts/skill_detail.js`). Structure mirrors
  // `knowledge_document_detail.json` 1:1 so the two detail experiences
  // stay consistent (a seller drilling into a Knowledge doc and a
  // Skill sees the same header / save / cancel / status affordances).
  //
  //   pageTitle             — `<title>` + <main aria-label> when a
  //                            row resolves. If `?id=` misses, this
  //                            + `notFound` copy render.
  //   navActive             — id of the currently-active left-nav
  //                            item; reuses "skills" so the same
  //                            left-nav item that lit up on
  //                            /skills.html stays highlighted while
  //                            the seller edits a specific skill.
  //   breadcrumb            — `rootLabel` + `rootHref` for the
  //                            "Skills / <name>" crumb trail. Kept
  //                            as data so a future "back to <origin>"
  //                            (search, drill-in from Home) can be
  //                            swapped without a template edit.
  //   back                  — fallback text-only back link used on
  //                            the not-found panel + on ultra-narrow
  //                            widths where the breadcrumb collapses.
  //   fallbackTitle         — SSR title text; the glue script
  //                            overwrites with the resolved skill's
  //                            `name` once the row hydrates.
  //   edited                — “Edited {updatedAt}” stamp that sits
  //                            12 px left of the header action group
  //                            (Figma 11606:25114). `{updatedAt}` is
  //                            compact-formatted by the glue script.
  //   actions               — labels for the header-right cluster.
  //                            Each item carries `label` (visible)
  //                            + `assistiveText` (aria-label + title
  //                            for icon-only affordances).
  //   notFound              — copy for the "skill not found" panel
  //                            (missing `?id=` or unknown id).
  //   save / cancel         — dirty-state commit copy — mirrors
  //                            knowledge_document_detail.json so the
  //                            two save flows read identically.
  //   status                — visually-hidden aria-live announcements
  //                            after save / cancel / draft restore.
  "detail": {
    "pageTitle": "Skill",
    "navActive": "skills",
    "breadcrumb": {
