    // ── Skill switcher (breadcrumb chevron → skill picker) ─────────
    // The chevron beside the current skill name opens a panel that
    // lists the catalog so a seller can hop between skills without
    // returning to /skills.html. Panel contents are built at runtime
    // by skill_detail.js from the inlined `catalog` + `tabs` blocks,
    // so adding a skill to `skills[]` lights it up here for free.
    //
    //   scope*        — the ownership picklist at the top of the
    //                   panel. Options come from `tabs.items` (the
    //                   same My / Learned / Shared split the list
    //                   page uses); `scopeCountLabel` names the
    //                   count that rides beside the selected scope.
    //   search*       — the filter field. Matches on skill name and
    //                   description, case-insensitive.
    //   updatedTemplate — the supporting line under each skill name.
    //                   Dropped when `updatedAt` is empty, same
    //                   resilience rule as the header metadata caption
    //                   above.
    //   new*          — the "+" button. Navigates to
    //                   /skill_detail.html?new=1 (empty canvas).
    "switcher": {
